    {
      "kind": "PLATFORM_COMPLEXITY_NOT_DEFECT",
      "detail": "Storage search/list code maintains two similar legacy/listing paths, pagination and partial-index-aware paths; they serve distinct contracts. Current project has zero buckets and no meaningful performance workload."
    },
